@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container-fluid bg-light py-5">
    <div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 900px;">
        <div class="mx-auto text-center mb-5">
            <h5 class="section-title px-3">Privacy</h5>
            <h1 class="mb-0">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
        </div>

        <p>
            At <strong>Cool Company E-Store</strong>, your privacy is important to us. This policy explains how we handle and protect your personal information when you visit our website or place an order.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">1. What Information Do We Collect?</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> When you register, we collect your name, email, and password.</li>
            <li><strong>Order Details:</strong> Including your shipping address, billing address, and order history.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> We use third-party payment processors; we do not store your full credit/debit card details.</li>
            <li><strong>Device & Usage Info:</strong> Such as your IP address, browser type, and pages visited (for analytics and optimization).</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">2. How Do We Use This Information?</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>To process and deliver your orders.</li>
            <li>To contact you regarding your purchases or support requests.</li>
            <li>To improve your shopping experience on our website.</li>
            <li>To comply with legal obligations and prevent fraud.</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">3. Cookies</h4>
        <p>
            Our website uses cookies to:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Maintain your login session.</li>
            <li>Remember cart contents.</li>
            <li>Analyze traffic and improve performance.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            You can disable cookies via your browser settings, but some features may not function properly.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">4. Third-Party Services</h4>
        <p>
            We may use trusted third-party tools (e.g., payment gateways, shipping partners) to complete your transactions. These parties are required to handle your data securely and in accordance with data protection regulations.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">5. Data Security</h4>
        <p>
            We implement security measures to protect your data, including HTTPS encryption, secure servers, and regular system updates.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">6. External Links</h4>
        <p>
            Our site may contain links to other websites. We are not responsible for their content or privacy policies. Please review their policies separately.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">7. Changes to This Policy</h4>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated date.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">8. Contact Us</h4>
        <p>
            If you have any questions or concerns about our Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, feel free to contact us:
        </p>
        <p>
            📧 <a href="mailto:info@coolcompany.com">info@coolcompany.com</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
